{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"17659","name":"The Roc Club, A Hotel to Live","description":"Suite Dreams. . . on the Attica Riviera Destination setting for just two or a whole party, Athens luxury hotel in Vouliagmeni-The ROC Club Vouliagmeni, combines the tranquillity and casual ambience of a resort with the lavish amenities of a boutique city hotel. Thirty-five premium deluxe guestrooms and suites, each individually furnished with the casual sophistication of a luxurious beach house, are the exclusive address for those who require the finer things in life. The ROC Club Vouliagmeni luxury hotel in Vouliagmeni, is located in the south-western suburb of Athens and just a 25-minute drive away from the city centre with great sea and sunset views. The beaches of the southern suburbs extend from Alimos to Vouliagmeni until Varkiza offering a full menu of amenities and services. Glyfada's Metaxa Street is one of the most commercial streets of Athens, and it leaves the dedicated shopper with nothing to be desired in terms of variety and choice.","address":"8, Panos & Chlois Str.","city":"VOULIAGMENI","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"16671","lat":37.810223,"lng":23.783754,"stars":5,"chain":"GRECO","giataCode":"60564","phone":"+302103805611","email":"reservations.vs@grecotel.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017659/017659a_hb_a_003_20250711_070256.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017659/017659a_hb_a_004_20250711_070314.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017659/017659a_hb_a_005_20250711_070328.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017659/017659a_hb_a_006_20250711_070335.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017659/017659a_hb_l_004.jpg","category":"lobby","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/